 "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T00:11:15.362Z",
 "source_selection": "Orden EEI/785/2024 (BOA no. 141, 22 July 2024) places Microsoft's Villamayor de Gállego campus on about 873,963 m2 north of the 'Polígono Malpica', between the A-2 and the town, and divides the delimitation into sub-areas 1 and 2 (access roads), 3 ('Campus de Centros de Datos') and 4 (auxiliary infrastructure). Orden PEJ/546/2025 (BOA no. 100, 28 May 2025) modifies the delimitation and lists in annex 2 the parcels of sub-area 3 with their affected areas: 30 rows covering 28 distinct cadastral references (some rows are sub-parcels or registry entries of the same reference). Each reference was retrieved individually from the Catastro INSPIRE WFS (GetParcel). Whole parcels are used, so the union (135.30 ha) is larger than the affected area (72.9 ha). Sub-areas 1, 2 and 4 are excluded, as are later sub-area 1 changes (Orden PEJ/626/2026).",
